# ============================================================
# FORCE NX - RELEASE DISTRIBUTION
# ============================================================

# Keep release source code and configuration tracked.
# Publish compiled binaries through GitHub Releases.
#
# If a dist directory is ignored elsewhere and you intentionally
# want to track release artifacts in Git, use these exceptions:
#
# !dist/
# !dist/*.zip
# !dist/*.exe
#
# Prefer GitHub Releases for large Windows packages.
